      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_select_04",
      "hash64": "FF16D45FB15249B7",
      "text": "으음...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_12",
      "hash64": "024BFC020AA28CDE",
      "text": "역시 우리 챔피언!\\n아주 믿음직한걸![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_13",
      "hash64": "024BFD020AA28E91",
      "text": "역시 우리 챔피언!\\n벌써 누구부터 부를지 고민하다니![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
